{:ts "2026-07-28T00:31:30Z", :kind :decision, :repo "https://github.com/octave-commons/fork_tales_v2", :origin "claude-code", :owner "claude-opus-5", :dod "Consolidate the scattered Fork Tales audio reconstruction system into this repository as its single definition, with paths corrected, blockers recorded, and render provenance preserved by hash.", :pi "eta-mu/receipt-river-v1", :host "local-shell", :manifest "docs/reconstruction/README.md, AGENTS.md, references/heresy-between/RENDERS-MANIFEST.edn", :refs "docs/reconstruction/*, resources/reconstruction/*, scripts/reconstruction/*, src/fork_tales/law/audio.cljc, references/heresy-between/*", :tests "clojure -M:test ran green: 14 tests, 43 assertions, 0 failures, 0 errors. Relocated Malli registry loaded via clojure -M -e (require 'fork-tales.law.audio) resolving 31 schemas. clj-kondo on src/fork_tales/law/audio.cljc: 0 errors, 0 warnings. All 3 contract EDN files and the 540-form RENDERS-MANIFEST.edn parsed with clojure.edn/read.", :decisions "Imported 426 evidence files (15M: json/ustx/mid/edn/csv/md and generator py/mjs) and deliberately excluded 540 render files (4.6G wav/png/mp3) as regenerable output, recording each render's size and sha256 in RENDERS-MANIFEST.edn instead. Corrected the /home/err/devel/Music -> /home/err/Music path drift in live docs, scripts, and contracts only; the 426 imported artifacts were left byte-identical because they are append-only historical records of real runs. Relocated the Malli pipeline registry from docs/ to src/fork_tales/law/audio.cljc, renaming ns fork-tales.audio.pipeline-schema to fork-tales.law.audio, since AGENTS.md scopes law/ to Malli contracts; no consumer required the old ns.", :drift "Three capabilities observed unavailable and recorded under :availability in fork_tales_audio_reconstruction.edn rather than assumed working: the OpenUTAU patched exporter (path absent, never committed, needs rebuild), demucs (not importable, no venv), and gemma4:e4b-128k (endpoint li